    "notes": "Pass 1 full extraction under rules 0.4 and themes 1.3. Read the cover note and table of contents and all sections: executive summary, economic outlook, public finance, structural challenges and the Reform Agenda (pages 19-21) and the annex on implementation of the 2025 policy guidance (pages 22-25). No Chapter 2 content. Extracted only passages where the digital issue itself is the subject: low digitalisation, broadband, digital government and e-services, security of digital infrastructure and government services, the Reform Agenda e-services measure, tax e-services and e-invoicing. Not extracted: the integrated financial management information system and the digitalisation of the PIM system (pages 5, 23, 24), the Public Revenue Office IT function and the new integrated IT tax system (page 23), all back-office or tax IT upgrades out under rules 0.4; the Reform Agenda list of areas including digitalisation (page 19, background); the ERP quality comment on the e-services impact analysis (page 21). Digitalisation of the Public Revenue Office and e-invoicing also appear in Box 1 (page 14, table restating page 13) and in the fiscal risks passage (page 16), where the claim concerns missing fiscal impact estimates; not extracted again. Period covered from the register. Text-file page numbers are printed page numbers plus one. Second-pass check done (G3 condition 2), see review/RUN-2026-01/second_pass/."
  },
